      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2016 Society for Adolescent Health and Medicine. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "This commentary describes young people's leadership from the perspective of a youth-led organization in the Link Up project in Burundi, Réseau National des Jeunes vivant avec le VIH. It describes processes that enable young people to guide, influence, deliver, and improve health service provision; the challenges faced by Réseau National des Jeunes vivant avec le VIH and how they are addressing these challenges."
      },
